.TH SUNO-EXPORT 1 "February 2026" "suno-export 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
suno-export \- download, process, and sync Suno tracks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B suno-export
[\fB--version\fR] [\fB--help\fR] <command> [options] [args]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B suno-export
is a CLI for downloading Suno tracks, fetching metadata, processing audio formats,
and running end-to-end sync workflows.
Default output directories are created automatically when needed.
.SH AUTHENTICATION
For commands that expose \fB--token\fR or \fB--browser\fR, at least one is required.
If \fB--browser\fR is passed without a value, default endpoint is \fBhttp://localhost:9222\fR.
If the specified endpoint is unavailable, the CLI falls back to launching a local debug browser session.
.SH BROWSER SESSION SETUP
Use \fB--browser\fR when you want to authenticate via a live Chrome debug session
instead of passing \fB--token\fR.
.TP
.B STEPS
1) Launch Chrome with remote debugging and a dedicated temp profile.
.br
2) Open https://suno.com and sign in.
.br
3) Keep that Chrome process running while executing \fBsuno-export ... --browser [url]\fR.
.TP
.B macOS example
\fBTMP_PROFILE="$(mktemp -d /tmp/suno-export-chrome.XXXXXX)"\fR
.br
\fB"/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome" --remote-debugging-port=9222 --user-data-dir="$TMP_PROFILE"\fR
.TP
.B Linux example
\fBTMP_PROFILE="$(mktemp -d /tmp/suno-export-chrome.XXXXXX)"\fR
.br
\fBgoogle-chrome --remote-debugging-port=9222 --user-data-dir="$TMP_PROFILE"\fR
.TP
.B Windows PowerShell example
\fB$tmp = New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path ([System.IO.Path]::GetTempPath()) -Name ("suno-export-chrome-" + [guid]::NewGuid())\fR
.br
\fB& "C:\\Program Files\\Google\\Chrome\\Application\\chrome.exe" --remote-debugging-port=9222 --user-data-dir="$($tmp.FullName)"\fR
.TP
.B Verify endpoint
\fBhttp://localhost:9222/json/version\fR
.TP
.B Troubleshooting
If connection fails, ensure the debug Chrome process is still running.
If unavailable, the CLI will auto-launch a local debug browser session and continue.
If auth state is stale, stop Chrome, remove the temp profile directory, and relaunch.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-V, --version
Print version.
.TP
.B \-h, --help
Print help.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS download
Download tracks from Suno.
.TP
.B SYNOPSIS
\fBsuno-export download\fR [options]
.TP
.B OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-t, --token <token>
Authentication token.
.TP
.B \-b, --browser [url]
Chrome DevTools endpoint (default: http://localhost:9222).
.TP
.B \-w, --workspace <id>
Only process one workspace ID.
.TP
.B \-f, --format <format>
Audio format: mp3|wav (default: wav).
.TP
.B \-o, --output <dir>
Output root (default: OS Downloads directory + /suno-export).
.TP
.B --copy-songs-metadata-to-output
Copy finalized songs_metadata.json to output on completion.
.TP
.B --no-metadata
Skip metadata sidecar behavior.
.TP
.B --created-after <date>
Only include tracks created on/after date.
.TP
.B --created-before <date>
Only include tracks created on/before date.
.TP
.B --delay <ms>
Delay between downloads (default: 1000).
.TP
.B --flush-cache
Clear local cache before run.
.SS sync
Run download then process.
.TP
.B SYNOPSIS
\fBsuno-export sync\fR [options]
.TP
.B OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-t, --token <token>
Authentication token.
.TP
.B \-b, --browser [url]
Chrome DevTools endpoint (default: http://localhost:9222).
.TP
.B \-w, --workspace <id>
Only process one workspace ID.
.TP
.B \-f, --format <format>
Download format: mp3|wav (default: wav).
.TP
.B \-o, --output <dir>
Download/output root (default: OS Downloads directory + /suno-export).
.TP
.B --copy-songs-metadata-to-output
Copy finalized songs_metadata.json to conversion output on completion.
.TP
.B --created-after <date>
Only include tracks created on/after date.
.TP
.B --created-before <date>
Only include tracks created on/before date.
.TP
.B --delay <ms>
Delay between downloads (default: 1000).
.TP
.B --flush-cache
Clear local cache before run.
.TP
.B --library <dir>
Converted output root (default: same as --output).
.TP
.B --process-formats <formats>
Formats CSV (default: flac,mp3,alac).
.TP
.B --process-bitrate <kbps>
MP3 bitrate (default: 320).
.TP
.B --process-concurrency <n>
Processing concurrency (default: 4).
.TP
.B --process-update-concurrency <n>
Update concurrency (default: 8).
.TP
.B --no-images
Skip image embedding.
.TP
.B --no-lyrics
Skip lyric embedding.
.TP
.B --exit-on-error
Stop on first conversion error.
.TP
.B NOTE
Conversion is queued immediately after each successful download (pipelined flow).
.SS process
Convert/embed metadata using an existing input root.
.TP
.B SYNOPSIS
\fBsuno-export process\fR \-i <path> \-o <path> [options]
.TP
.B OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-i, --input <path>
Input root. Required.
.TP
.B \-o, --output <path>
Output root. Required.
.TP
.B --copy-songs-metadata-to-output
Copy finalized songs_metadata.json to output on completion.
.TP
.B --process-formats <formats>
Formats CSV (default: flac,mp3,alac).
.TP
.B --process-bitrate <kbps>
MP3 bitrate (default: 320).
.TP
.B --process-concurrency <n>
Processing concurrency (default: 4).
.TP
.B --process-update-concurrency <n>
Update concurrency (default: 8).
.TP
.B --no-images
Skip image embedding.
.TP
.B --no-lyrics
Skip lyric embedding.
.TP
.B --exit-on-error
Exit on processing error.
.TP
.B --reconvert-before <iso>
Only reconvert on/before timestamp.
.TP
.B --reconvert-after <iso>
Only reconvert on/after timestamp.
.TP
.B --reconvert-missing
Only process missing formats.
.SS download-images
Download artwork from explicit list or discovered missing items.
.TP
.B SYNOPSIS
\fBsuno-export download-images\fR [options]
.TP
.B OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-l, --list <file>
Input JSON list with clipId/thumbnail.
.TP
.B \-t, --token <token>
Authentication token.
.TP
.B \-b, --browser [url]
Chrome DevTools endpoint (default: http://localhost:9222).
.TP
.B \-o, --output <dir>
Output root (default: OS Downloads directory + /suno-export).
.TP
.B --copy-songs-metadata-to-output
Copy finalized songs_metadata.json to output on completion.
.TP
.B --fetch-image-list <file>
Discover missing images and write JSON list.
.TP
.B --fetch-missing
Discover missing images and download directly.
.TP
.B --delay <ms>
Delay between image downloads (default: 1000).
.TP
.B NOTES
Pass at least one of --list, --fetch-image-list, --fetch-missing.
Do not combine --list with --fetch-image-list.
.SS list
List tracks.
.TP
.B SYNOPSIS
\fBsuno-export list\fR [options]
.TP
.B OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-t, --token <token>
Authentication token.
.TP
.B \-b, --browser [url]
Chrome DevTools endpoint (default: http://localhost:9222).
.TP
.B \-w, --workspace <id>
Only list this workspace.
.TP
.B --json
Emit JSON.
.SS workspaces
List workspaces.
.TP
.B SYNOPSIS
\fBsuno-export workspaces\fR [options]
.TP
.B OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-t, --token <token>
Authentication token.
.TP
.B \-b, --browser [url]
Chrome DevTools endpoint (default: http://localhost:9222).
.TP
.B --json
Emit JSON.
.SS metadata
Fetch metadata for one track.
.TP
.B SYNOPSIS
\fBsuno-export metadata\fR <trackId> [options]
.TP
.B ARGUMENTS
.TP
.B <trackId>
Suno track ID.
.TP
.B OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-t, --token <token>
Authentication token.
.TP
.B \-b, --browser [url]
Chrome DevTools endpoint (default: http://localhost:9222).
.SS fetch-metadata
Fetch and cache metadata for many tracks.
.TP
.B SYNOPSIS
\fBsuno-export fetch-metadata\fR [options]
.TP
.B OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-t, --token <token>
Authentication token.
.TP
.B \-b, --browser [url]
Chrome DevTools endpoint (default: http://localhost:9222).
.TP
.B --ids <ids>
Comma-separated track IDs.
.TP
.B \-w, --workspace <id>
Workspace scope for discovery mode.
.TP
.B --created-after <date>
Only include tracks created on/after date.
.TP
.B --created-before <date>
Only include tracks created on/before date.
.TP
.B NOTES
--ids cannot be combined with --workspace/--created-after/--created-before.
.SS refresh
Refresh cached tracks.
.TP
.B SYNOPSIS
\fBsuno-export refresh\fR [options]
.TP
.B OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-t, --token <token>
Authentication token.
.TP
.B \-b, --browser [url]
Chrome DevTools endpoint (default: http://localhost:9222).
.SH DATE FILTERS
Commands with creation date filters accept:
.IP \(bu 2
ISO timestamps (example: \fB2026-02-01T12:00:00Z\fR)
.IP \(bu 2
Date-only values (\fBYYYY-MM-DD\fR), interpreted as inclusive UTC day bounds.
.SH SONGS METADATA
Authoritative \fBsongs_metadata.json\fR lives on the input side.
Backups are created there.
If \fB--copy-songs-metadata-to-output\fR is provided, a finalized copy is written
to the output side at completion.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
\fBsuno-export download --token TOKEN --output ./downloads\fR
Download tracks to \fB./downloads\fR.
.TP
\fBsuno-export download --browser http://localhost:9222 --created-after 2026-01-01\fR
Download with browser auth and date filter.
.TP
\fBsuno-export sync --browser http://localhost:9222 --output ./downloads --library ./library\fR
Download then convert into \fB./library\fR.
.TP
\fBsuno-export process -i ./downloads -o ./library --reconvert-missing\fR
Process missing formats from an existing download root.
.TP
\fBsuno-export download-images --fetch-image-list ./image_list.json\fR
Generate image download list.
.TP
\fBsuno-export download-images --fetch-missing --browser http://localhost:9222\fR
Discover and download missing images.
.TP
\fBsuno-export fetch-metadata --ids id1,id2,id3\fR
Fetch metadata for explicit track IDs.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ffmpeg (1),
.BR metaflac (1),
.BR atomicparsley (1)
